epdiy — parallel e-paper driver
Upstream: https://github.com/vroland/epdiy
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later (see idf_component.yml)

本目录是 epdiy 的 fork，按 upstream 的 v2.0.0（组件版本号见 idf_component.yml）
裁剪而来，只保留 ESP32-S3 的 LCD 外设输出路径与本板需要的显示定义，本地改动包括：

- 删除 ESP32 的 I2S 输出路径（src/output_i2s/）、社区波形表与示例图片
- src/board/ 换成本板定义（引脚在 components/read_pico/read_pico_board.c 里注册）
- src/displays.c 只保留 4.7" 1216x684 单色面板（E0470_DISPLAY）
- 波形表改为从 components/e0470_epaper_waveform 取
- src/render.c / highlevel.c：差分按列裁剪、按 (from,to) 直方图无损跳过前导空相位、
  统计各阶段耗时；output_lcd/render_lcd.c：可配置的帧前预填行数

This directory is a trimmed fork of epdiy v2.0.0: only the ESP32-S3 LCD render
path and the display definition for this board are kept. Local changes are
listed above.

- output_lcd/render_lcd.c：扫描未消费完即结束时中止相位，汇合生产者后清理行队列，防止下一相位死锁。
  Abort incomplete scan phases and clear queues after joining producers to prevent next-phase deadlock.

- 新增 src/output_common/nonxtensa_ve_fallback.c：lut.S / diff.S 的等价 C 实现，供 RISC-V 目标
  （ESP32-S31，Metalio E-Ink4-Plus）使用；同时把两个 .S 的 xtensa 头移进 CONFIG_IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
  守卫内，epd_board.h 的 xtensa 头改为条件包含，epd_busy_delay() 改用 esp_cpu_get_cycle_count()。
  Added src/output_common/nonxtensa_ve_fallback.c: C equivalents of lut.S / diff.S for RISC-V
  targets (ESP32-S31, Metalio E-Ink4-Plus), with the xtensa includes moved inside the
  CONFIG_IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 guard, epd_board.h's xtensa include made conditional, and
  epd_busy_delay() switched to esp_cpu_get_cycle_count().

- src/displays.c：Metalio 板的 ED047TC2 是 8 位/20MHz，与 Read Pico 的 16 位/24MHz 按板分叉。
  src/displays.c: the Metalio board's ED047TC2 is 8-bit at 20 MHz, split by board from
  Read Pico's 16-bit at 24 MHz.
- output_lcd/lcd_driver.c 与 render_lcd.c 补齐 ESP32-S31：专用 LCD_DATA IOMUX、
  cache 一致的回弹缓冲（bb_behind_cache + esp_cache_msync）、SRAM 与传输缓冲供电、
  以及 HAL 未开的像素时钟门；S31 上跳过 cache 预取。
  ESP32-S31 support in output_lcd/lcd_driver.c and render_lcd.c: the dedicated LCD_DATA
  IOMUX, cache-coherent bounce buffers, SRAM/transmit-buffer power, and the pixel-clock
  gate the HAL leaves shut; the cache prefetch is skipped on S31.

